  - Name: Lightning Bolt
    NameEs: "Descarga el\xE9ctrica"
    Description: Instant bolt. It bounces to as many nearby enemies as arcane points
      the target has. 10 mana.
    DescriptionEs: "Rayo instant\xE1neo. Rebota a tantos enemigos cercanos como puntos
